    "name": "caveman",
    "description": "Terse caveman voice: answer first, fluff gone, every technical fact kept. Use for /caveman, \"caveman mode\", \"talk like caveman\", \"be brief\", \"less tokens\". Stays on until \"stop caveman\" or \"normal mode\".",
    "version": "1.0.0",
